            "review_title": "Review at Imotaro",
            "review_text": "Lien Bui\n1 contribution\n0\nTERRIBLE WAITRESS AND MANAGER\nAug 2019\nMy friend and I had lunch at this restaurant on 28 Aug 2019. We unluckily met the most terrible, disrespectful, absurd, unprofessional and impertinent human being ever. Her name is Trang. At first, she served us with a horrible attitude, no greeting, no politeness, and she was very cranky. She put food on the table without saying any word, like we were not there. After the lunch, we talked politely and gently with her in private about her poor attitude. She became even crankier, and talked back at us \"I won't be working here anymore, so whatever\" (in Vietnamese: Cuoi tuan nay em nghi roi chi oi). I was extremely furious about her attitude at that point. I decided to complained with her manager. But again, the manager also disappointed me with her straight face. By that, I realized I couldn't improve the situation anymore, so I walked out of the restaurant.\nThe food is not excellent, but with this poor service, we would never come back here again, and would never recommend this place to anyone.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 29, 2019",
