            "review_title": "Review at Imotaro",
            "review_text": "Lien Bui\n1 contribution\n0\nThe worst service we’ ever used\nAug 2019 • Couples\nI and my friend had lunch at this restaurant on 28 August 2019. Our table was served by a waitress named Trang. This human being is the worst waitress I’ve ever seen. Throughout our lunch, she never responded with an appropriate attitude. She is careless, absurd, disrespectful and highly unprofessional. At the end of our lunch, we were extremely disappointed with her performance and talked to her in private. Not only she didn’t apologize, she also talked back to us with mean words, “I won’t be working here anymore by the end of this week anyway!” and walked away. I was so furious and this time, I complained with her manager. Guess what, the manager stood there listening to us, but didn’t take any prompt action, and just remained silent. \nThis is not the first time we see them serve us unprofessionally, but this case is overwhelming!\nI would never go back to this restaurant again and wouldn’t recommend to any of you!\n\nThis is a totally true story, and I was furious one day later, like they ruined my whole day afterwards.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 29, 2019\nShintaroYoshimura\nThank you for rating us. We took your 1 star rating solemnly. I sincerely apologize for that. I’ll talk with her and manager as soon as possible. We’ll improve our quality of service and more.\nAgain, we apologize for the inconvenience.\nRead more\nWritten August 29, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
