            "review_text": "Badexperience214\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam120 contributions\n0\nI love here\nJun 2018 • Solo\nI have been visiting this restaurant for many years, every time when I don’t know what to eat, here always my first choice! The food may not the best, price is affordable probably, but what I really love of this place is a kind if safe, quiet and friendly environment they have. I love their hotspot by the way, Asian test!\n食物也許不是最棒，價格也不是最美，但每每人要的不同吧！來越南幾年了，我每次不知道要吃什麼時就是來這！除了讓我有安心、平靜的感覺之外，和善的環境也是吸引我的地方。我真的喜歡他們的日式火鍋，清淡又不膩。\nRead more\nWritten June 19, 2018",
