            "review_text": "Stadzy\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam21 contributions\n0\nThe Shogun of Japanese restaurants\nAug 2015 • Friends\nWent here for my birthday meal with a few friends and it was fantastic! Huge menu which made it super difficult to decided what to get. We ended up getting tons anyway and everything that was served was delicious. The venue itself is cool and everything is clean. Staff are a bit slow and the manager was a little rude but we did have a great time. The owner even offered us 2 free Beef tongue dishes as it was my birthday. I hated the thought of it until i tried it. I will be back for sure!!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 20, 2015",
